3.2. Configure RBCD on the target 'MEMBER$' machine to allow the new 'ATTACKBOX$' account to act as a delegate
3.3. Request a service ticket for the target machine using the 'ATTACKBOX$' account credentials via 'getST'
3.4. Execute remote commands on the target machine using the forged service ticket via 'wmiexec'
